                <h2>适用场景与前提</h2>
<p>本 SOP 适用于 TikTok Shop 美区/东南亚小店的新品上架前 30 天冷启动阶段。执行前请确保：<br />
- 已完成选品调研，确认产品卖点与目标人群<br />
- 已开通广告账户并完成像素/事件配置<br />
- 有至少 1 名剪辑人员和 2 名拍摄人员的执行资源</p>
<hr />
<h2>Step 1：竞品素材调研与卖点拆解</h2>
<h3>操作步骤</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>扒取同类目 Top 50 带货视频</strong></li>
<li>在 TikTok Creator Marketplace 或第三方工具（如 Pulsar、Influencer Intelligence）筛选近 30 天高播放、高转化挂车视频</li>
<li>
<p>记录每条视频的完播率、点赞/评论比、带货 GMV（估算）</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>建立竞品素材分析表</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>分析维度</th>
<th>记录内容</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>视频结构</td>
<td>前 3 秒钩子类型（痛点/好奇/利益点）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>内容形式</td>
<td>情景剧/测评/口播/UGC 二创</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>字幕风格</td>
<td>动态大字/关键词高亮/无字幕</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>背景音乐</td>
<td>热门音乐名称/无音乐/原声</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>转化路径</td>
<td>评论区引导/小黄车/购物车图标</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<ol>
<li><strong>提炼 3-5 个核心卖点脚本框架</strong></li>
<li>按"痛点-方案-效果"结构整理</li>
<li>保留竞品常用话术，标注差异化方向</li>
</ol>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>检查点</strong>：完成至少 10 条竞品视频的结构拆解，产出卖点脚本草稿。</p>
</blockquote>
<hr />
<h2>Step 2：素材类型规划与产能分配</h2>
<h3>冷启动素材池建议配比</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>素材类型</th>
<th>占比</th>
<th>单条时长</th>
<th>数量建议</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>痛点情景剧</td>
<td>30%</td>
<td>15-30s</td>
<td>6-8 条</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>产品测评/开箱</td>
<td>25%</td>
<td>20-45s</td>
<td>5-6 条</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>UGC 口播/种草</td>
<td>25%</td>
<td>10-20s</td>
<td>5-6 条</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>促销信息流</td>
<td>20%</td>
<td>8-15s</td>
<td>4-5 条</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>执行要点</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>痛点情景剧</strong>：聚焦 1-2 个用户高频痛点，场景贴近目标用户的真实使用场景（厨房、卧室、健身房等）</li>
<li><strong>产品测评</strong>：优先选择有真实使用过程的场景，避免纯产品展示</li>
<li><strong>UGC 口播</strong>：可由外籍模特出镜，语速稍快，配合字幕增强信息密度</li>
<li><strong>促销信息流</strong>：强利益点前置，如"今日 5 折""前 100 名赠品"，末尾加行动号召（CTA）</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>Step 3：素材生产标准与输出规范</h2>
<h3>拍摄标准</h3>
<ul>
<li>分辨率：1080P × 1080P（1:1）或 1080P × 1920P（9:16）</li>
<li>帧率：30fps 或 60fps</li>
<li>光线：自然光优先，避免过曝或逆光</li>
<li>音频：单独保存原声轨道，背景音乐单独文件</li>
</ul>
<h3>剪辑要求</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>前 3 秒必须有视觉钩子</strong></li>
<li>示例：产品特写+字幕爆炸效果 / 模特表情对比 / 数据图表</li>
<li><strong>字幕必须嵌入视频</strong></li>
<li>字体：加粗黑体</li>
<li>颜色：白字黑边</li>
<li>位置：避开产品主体区域</li>
<li><strong>CTA 必须在 12-15 秒处出现</strong></li>
<li>话术参考："Tap the cart" / "Shop now" / "Limited stock"</li>
</ol>
<h3>文件命名规范</h3>
<pre><code>日期_产品名_素材类型_序号_版本
例：20240115_smartwatch_review_A_v1
</code></pre>
<hr />
<h2>Step 4：素材测试与分层管理</h2>
<h3>测试矩阵执行</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>首轮测试（3-5 天）</strong></li>
<li>每个素材类型至少 3 条进入测试</li>
<li>预算：每条 $20-30/天</li>
<li>
<p>指标优先：3 秒完播率 &gt; CTR &gt; CPC</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>素材分层标准</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>层级</th>
<th>3 秒完播率</th>
<th>处置</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>A 级</td>
<td>≥45%</td>
<td>主力放量，追加 5-10 条变体</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>B 级</td>
<td>30%-45%</td>
<td>持续观察，优化 CTA 或字幕</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C 级</td>
<td>&lt;30%</td>
<td>暂停，保留素材结构换产品重新剪辑</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<ol>
<li><strong>变体扩展策略</strong></li>
<li>A 级素材拆解：换背景音乐 / 换字幕颜色 / 换开头 3 秒</li>
<li>每个 A 级素材至少产出 3 个变体进入第二轮测试</li>
</ol>
<hr />
<h2>Step 5：素材池维护与迭代节奏</h2>
<h3>日常运营节奏</h3>
<ul>
<li>每日：监控跑量素材数据，更新分层表</li>
<li>每周：淘汰 C 级素材，规划下周的拍摄主题</li>
<li>每两周：根据 GMV 数据复盘 ROI，调整素材配比</li>
</ul>
<h3>防止素材疲劳</h3>
<ul>
<li>同一广告组内避免超过 5 条相似素材同时跑</li>
<li>每周至少更新 20% 的素材，保持新鲜度</li>
<li>关注 TikTok Trends 页面，及时蹭热点调整 BGM 或字幕风格</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>常见问题 Q&amp;A</h2>
<p><strong>Q：冷启动阶段素材数量多少合适？</strong><br />
A：建议首周至少 15-20 条，涵盖 3-4 种类型，确保有足够测试样本。</p>
<p><strong>Q：没有专业模特怎么办？</strong><br />
A：优先找外籍素人出镜，口播类素材可用产品特写+字幕替代，降低对真人依赖。</p>
<p><strong>Q：测试期数据不好是否立即停投？</strong><br />
A：3 秒完播率低于 25% 且 CTR 低于 0.5% 时建议暂停；数据在临界值时可先换变体测试。</p>
<hr />
<h2>快速检查清单</h2>
<ul>
<li>[ ] 完成 10+ 条竞品视频结构拆解</li>
<li>[ ] 产出 3-5 个卖点脚本框架</li>
<li>[ ] 素材类型配比符合建议比例</li>
<li>[ ] 所有素材完成字幕嵌入</li>
<li>[ ] 首轮测试每条素材预算 ≥$20</li>
<li>[ ] 建立素材分层表，每日更新数据</li>
<li>[ ] A 级素材已扩展变体并进入第二轮测试</li>
<li>[ ] 设置每周素材更新提醒</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<p><em>按此 SOP 执行，团队可在 2 周内完成冷启动素材池的初步搭建，并通过数据迭代持续优化投放效果。</em></p>
            </div>
            <div class="prose max-w-none" x-show="lang === 'en'" x-cloak>
                <h2>When to Use This SOP</h2>
<p>This SOP applies to the first 30 days of cold start for TikTok Shop products in US or Southeast Asia markets. Before starting, ensure:<br />
- Product research and target audience profiling are completed<br />
- Ad accounts are active with pixel/events properly configured<br />
- At least 1 video editor and 2 shooters available for production</p>
<hr />
<h2>Step 1: Competitor Research &amp; USP Breakdown</h2>
<h3>Actions</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>Collect top 50 promoted videos in your category</strong></li>
<li>Use TikTok Creator Marketplace or third-party tools (e.g., Pulsar) to filter high-view, high-conversion videos from the past 30 days</li>
<li>
<p>Note completion rate, like/comment ratio, and estimated GMV for each video</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Build a competitor creative analysis table</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Dimension</th>
<th>What to Record</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Video structure</td>
<td>Hook type in first 3 seconds (pain point, curiosity, benefit)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Content format</td>
<td>Scenario, review, talking head, UGC remake</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Subtitle style</td>
<td>Animated text, keyword highlight, no subtitles</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Background music</td>
<td>Trending track name, no music, original audio</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Conversion path</td>
<td>Comment guidance, product link, cart icon</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<ol>
<li><strong>Extract 3-5 core USP script frameworks</strong></li>
<li>Structure as "pain point → solution → result"</li>
<li>Keep competitor messaging, mark areas for differentiation</li>
</ol>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Checkpoint</strong>: Complete structural analysis of at least 10 competitor videos and draft USP scripts.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr />
<h2>Step 2: Creative Type Planning &amp; Resource Allocation</h2>
<h3>Recommended Asset Mix for Cold Start</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Creative Type</th>
<th>Share</th>
<th>Duration</th>
<th>Quantity</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Pain point scenario</td>
<td>30%</td>
<td>15-30s</td>
<td>6-8</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Product review/unboxing</td>
<td>25%</td>
<td>20-45s</td>
<td>5-6</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>UGC talking head</td>
<td>25%</td>
<td>10-20s</td>
<td>5-6</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Promotional feed</td>
<td>20%</td>
<td>8-15s</td>
<td>4-5</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>Execution Tips</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Pain point scenarios</strong>: Focus on 1-2 high-frequency user pain points, use scenes close to real usage (kitchen, bedroom, gym)</li>
<li><strong>Product reviews</strong>: Prioritize authentic usage scenarios over pure product display</li>
<li><strong>UGC talking heads</strong>: Can use foreign models, slightly faster speech pace, pair with text overlays for higher information density</li>
<li><strong>Promotional feed</strong>: Lead with strong benefits like "50% off today" or "Free gift for first 100", end with clear CTA</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>Step 3: Production Standards &amp; Output Specifications</h2>
<h3>Shooting Standards</h3>
<ul>
<li>Resolution: 1080P × 1080P (1:1) or 1080P × 1920P (9:16)</li>
<li>Frame rate: 30fps or 60fps</li>
<li>Lighting: Natural light preferred, avoid overexposure or backlight</li>
<li>Audio: Save original track separately, background music as separate file</li>
</ul>
<h3>Editing Requirements</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>First 3 seconds must have a visual hook</strong></li>
<li>Examples: Product close-up + explosion text effect / Model reaction comparison / Data chart</li>
<li><strong>Subtitles must be embedded in video</strong></li>
<li>Font: Bold black</li>
<li>Color: White with black outline</li>
<li>Position: Avoid covering main product area</li>
<li><strong>CTA must appear at 12-15 seconds</strong></li>
<li>Sample copy: "Tap the cart" / "Shop now" / "Limited stock"</li>
</ol>
<h3>File Naming Convention</h3>
<pre><code>Date_ProductName_CreativeType_Number_Version
Example: 20240115_smartwatch_review_A_v1
</code></pre>
<hr />
<h2>Step 4: Testing &amp; Asset Tiering</h2>
<h3>Testing Matrix Execution</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>First round (3-5 days)</strong></li>
<li>At least 3 creatives per type enter testing</li>
<li>Budget: $20-30/day per creative</li>
<li>
<p>Priority metrics: 3-second completion rate &gt; CTR &gt; CPC</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Asset Tiering Criteria</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Tier</th>
<th>3-Second Completion</th>
<th>Action</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>A</td>
<td>≥45%</td>
<td>Scale up, create 5-10 variants</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>B</td>
<td>30%-45%</td>
<td>Continue monitoring, optimize CTA or subtitles</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C</td>
<td>&lt;30%</td>
<td>Pause, keep structure and re-edit with different product</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<ol>
<li><strong>Variant Expansion Strategy</strong></li>
